# Auto-fetched 3D assets (use `pnpm fetch:3d`).  We commit the dir layout
# (public/3d/{hdr,cast,props}/) and README but never the binary asset blobs
# themselves — they're CC0 / redownloadable, can be hundreds of MB, and the
# 3D renderer falls back gracefully when files are missing.
public/3d/hdr/*.hdr
public/3d/cast/*.glb
public/3d/cast/_quaternius/
public/3d/cast/_kenney/
public/3d/props/*.glb
public/3d/props/_quaternius-medical/
